{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"product_name\":\"FC2088手持金属探测器\",\"product_name_en\":\"Handheld Metal Detector FC2088\",\"summary\":\"FC2088 是一款新款高灵敏度手持金属探测器，可广泛应用于各类安全检查领域。该设备具有灵敏度可调功能，探测精度优于同类产品。采用耐摔、耐用的高品质外壳设计，即使在 9V 电池电量降至 7V 时，探测距离依然保持稳定。设备极其省电，可连续工作 40 小时以上，并具备自动低压声光报警、开关机提示、声光/振动切换等人性化功能，适用于机场、车站、海关、保卫部门及考场防作弊等多种场景。\",\"summary_en\":\"The FC2088 is a newly designed high-sensitivity handheld metal detector suitable for a wide range of security screening applications. It features adjustable sensitivity, offering detection precision that outperforms similar products in its class. Built with a durable, impact-resistant casing, it maintains a consistent detection range even when the 9V battery voltage drops to 7V. The device is exceptionally energy-efficient, supporting over 40 hours of continuous operation. It includes user-friendly features such as automatic low-battery alerts, power-on/off sound prompts, and selectable audio-visual or vibration alarm modes, making it ideal for airports, stations, customs, security departments, and preventing cheating in examination halls.\",\"key_application\":\"应用领域：FC2088手持金属探测器；新款高灵敏度手持，可以应用任何领域；具有灵敏度可调功能，与其它手持探测器相比，灵敏度较高。\",\"key_application_en\":\"High-sensitivity metal detection for airports, stations, and exam halls; identifies coins, keys, and weapons; adjustable sensitivity for custom security levels; long-endurance (40h+) with vibration/audio alerts.\",\"key_parameter_1\":\"探测距离: 大头针 1-3cm；38口径手枪 10-15cm\",\"key_parameter_1_en\":\"Detection Range: Pin (1-3cm); .38 Caliber Pistol (10-15cm)\",\"key_parameter_2\":\"连续工作时间: ≥40小时\",\"key_parameter_2_en\":\"Operating Time: ≥40 hours continuous\",\"parameters\":{\"灵敏度\":\"高灵敏度，支持手动旋钮调节\",\"警报模式\":\"声光报警、振动报警可切换\",\"探测能力\":\"大头针 (1-3cm)、剃须刀片 (2-10cm)、手枪 (10-15cm)、手机电池 (15-25cm)\",\"电池\":\"标准 9V 层叠电池，支持外接充电\",\"低电压提示\":\"电池用完时自动连续告警，电压低至7V探测距离不变\",\"功耗\":\"极低功耗，单次充电/更换电池可工作 40h+\",\"防护设计\":\"耐摔耐用外壳，带开/关机声音提示\",\"用途\":\"机场/车站安检、公检法边防检查、贵金属检测、考场防作弊\"},\"paramete